exports[`EditorialArticle.astro — full-page integration snapshots > industries group: locks full page HTML for representative fixture (industries/luxury-brands.json) 1`] = `"<div class=\\"woocommerce kadence-woo-messages-none-woo-pages woocommerce-notices-wrapper\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"173:2\\"></div>   <div class=\\"content-wrap codex-editorial-pillar--with-rail\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"188:31\\"> <article class=\\"entry content-bg single-entry page type-page status-publish hentry codex-editorial-page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"189:108\\"> <div class=\\"entry-content-wrap\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"190:37\\"> <div class=\\"entry-content single-content\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"191:49\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-dates\\" hidden aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"192:70\\"> <time class=\\"entry-date published\\" datetime=\\"2026-04-18\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"193:67\\">2026-04-18</time> <time class=\\"updated\\" datetime=\\"2026-06-11T11:00:00Z\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"194:53\\">2026-06-11</time> </div> <nav class=\\"codex-editorial-trail\\" aria-label=\\"Breadcrumb\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"96:60\\"> <a href=\\"/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">Home</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><a href=\\"/industries/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">Industries</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><span aria-current=\\"page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"100:35\\">Luxury Brand NFC</span> </nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-hero\\" data-page-type=\\"product\\" data-hero-layout=\\"stacked\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"115:106\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-copy\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"116:42\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"117:39\\">Luxury NFC</p> <h1 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"118:9\\">Luxury Brand NFC</h1> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-deck\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"119:61\\">Tap-to-Verify &amp; DPP</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-byline\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"121:41\\">By <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#editorial-board\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"122:63\\">Proud Tek Editorial Board</a> · Reviewed by <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#peter-zhang\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"127:67\\">Peter Zhang</a> · Updated <time datetime=\\"2026-06-11\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"132:66\\">Jun 2026</time></p>  <div class=\\"codex-editorial-answer\\" aria-label=\\"Quick answer\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"213:67\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"214:47\\">Quick answer</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-summary\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"215:8\\">Luxury NFC embeds NXP NTAG 424 DNA or NTAG 424 DNA TagTamper inlays (ISO/IEC 14443 Type A, 13.56 MHz, AES-128 SUN/CMAC per NXP AN12196 and NIST SP 800-38B) invisibly into handbags, watch case backs, sneaker tongues, wine capsules and packaging closures, so each tap on an iPhone (iOS 14+) or Android phone returns a fresh cryptographic signature that consumer-grade clones cannot forge. The same tap doubles as the carrier for the EU Digital Product Passport mandated by Regulation 2024/1781 (ESPR), shaped as a GS1 Digital Link URL, and feeds certified-pre-owned provenance ledgers such as the Aura Blockchain Consortium (LVMH, Prada, Richemont, OTB, Mercedes-Benz) and ARIANEE. Industry data shows tap-to-verify pages converting at 25-50% versus single-digit rates for app-gated flows and a 60-80% drop in marketplace counterfeit-listing takedown latency.</p> </div> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-points\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"217:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Tap-to-verify on any NFC phone — no app, no friction. Each tap returns a fresh AES-128 CMAC-signed URL (SUN/SDM); cloning and replay both fail server verification.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">DPP-ready from day one — the tap URL can be encoded as a GS1 Digital Link, which is the pattern the EU Digital Product Passport (ESPR, 2024/1781) points toward for textiles and consumer goods.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Resale provenance — the same chip that confirms authenticity at point of sale carries ownership transfer and service history into the secondary market, underpinning certified-pre-owned programs.</li> </ul>  <div class=\\"codex-hero-cta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"222:37\\"> <a class=\\"codex-hero-cta-btn\\" data-cta-tier=\\"hero\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"223:84\\">Request samples</a>  </div> <div class=\\"codex-hero-trust-bar\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"232:43\\"> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:25\\">Since 2008</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:25\\">ISO 9001</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:25\\">500+</strong> Clients</span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:25\\">50+</strong> Countries</span> </div>  </div> </section>     <section class=\\"codex-industries-cat-products\\" aria-label=\\"Products for Luxury Brands\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:93\\"> <h2 class=\\"codex-industries-cat-products__title\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:52\\">Featured Luxury Brands Products</h2> <p class=\\"codex-industries-cat-products__sub\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:49\\">Explore our complete range of RFID solutions for luxury brands.</p> <div class=\\"codex-industries-cat-products__grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:52\\"> <a href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/nfc-luxury-handbag-tag/\\" class=\\"codex-card codex-card--media codex-industries-cat-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:91\\"> <div class=\\"codex-industries-cat-card__placeholder\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/IndustryProductGrid.astro\\" da