urces.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"62:97\\">NIST SP 800-38B — The CMAC Mode for Authentication</a><span class=\\"codex-sources-meta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"63:44\\"><span class=\\"codex-sources-publisher\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:51\\">NIST</span><span class=\\"codex-sources-date\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:126\\"> · Jan 1, 2016</span><span class=\\"codex-sources-accessed\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:208\\"> · accessed Apr 23, 2026</span></span></li><li id=\\"sources-9\\" class=\\"codex-sources-item\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"60:71\\"><span class=\\"codex-sources-num\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"61:62\\">9.</span><a class=\\"codex-sources-link\\" href=\\"https://www.arianee.org/\\" rel=\\"noopener external\\" target=\\"_blank\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"62:97\\">ARIANEE — Independent luxury provenance protocol</a><span class=\\"codex-sources-meta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"63:44\\"><span class=\\"codex-sources-publisher\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:51\\">Arianee Association</span><span class=\\"codex-sources-accessed\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:208\\"> · accessed Apr 23, 2026</span></span><p class=\\"codex-sources-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"65:62\\">Public-consortium provenance protocol used by Breitling, IWC and other maisons alongside or in place of Aura.</p></li><li id=\\"sources-10\\" class=\\"codex-sources-item\\" tabindex=\\"-1\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"60:71\\"><span class=\\"codex-sources-num\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"61:62\\">10.</span><a class=\\"codex-sources-link\\" href=\\"https://www.iso.org/standard/85540.html\\" rel=\\"noopener external\\" target=\\"_blank\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"62:97\\">ISO/IEC 18975:2024 — GS1 Digital Link standard</a><span class=\\"codex-sources-meta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"63:44\\"><span class=\\"codex-sources-publisher\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:51\\">ISO</span><span class=\\"codex-sources-date\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:126\\"> · Jan 1, 2024</span><span class=\\"codex-sources-accessed\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"64:208\\"> · accessed Apr 23, 2026</span></span><p class=\\"codex-sources-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Sources.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"65:62\\">International Standard formalisation of the GS1 Digital Link URL shape required for EU Digital Product Passport readiness.</p></li></ol></section> <section class=\\"codex-trust-signals\\" data-astro-source-