exports[`EditorialArticle.astro — full-page integration snapshots > lp group: locks full page HTML for representative fixture (lp/rfid-tag-wholesale.json) 1`] = `"<div class=\\"woocommerce kadence-woo-messages-none-woo-pages woocommerce-notices-wrapper\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"173:2\\"></div>   <div class=\\"content-wrap\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"188:31\\"> <article class=\\"entry content-bg single-entry page type-page status-publish hentry codex-editorial-page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"189:108\\"> <div class=\\"entry-content-wrap\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"190:37\\"> <div class=\\"entry-content single-content\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"191:49\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-dates\\" hidden aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"192:70\\"> <time class=\\"entry-date published\\" datetime=\\"2026-01-15T00:00:00.000Z\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"193:67\\">2026-01-15</time> <time class=\\"updated\\" datetime=\\"2026-06-11T11:00:00Z\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialArticle.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"194:53\\">2026-06-11</time> </div> <nav class=\\"codex-editorial-trail\\" aria-label=\\"Breadcrumb\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"96:60\\"> <a href=\\"/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">Home</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><a href=\\"/contact/rfid-labels-tags/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">Contact</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><span aria-current=\\"page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"100:35\\">RFID Tag Wholesale</span> </nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-hero\\" data-page-type=\\"lp\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"115:106\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-copy\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"116:42\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"117:39\\">Wholesale RFID Tags</p> <h1 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"118:9\\">RFID Tag Wholesale</h1> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-deck\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"119:61\\">Distributor Volume Pricing</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-byline\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"121:41\\">By <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#editorial-board\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"122:63\\">Proud Tek Editorial Board</a> · Reviewed by <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#peter-zhang\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"127:67\\">Peter Zhang</a> · Updated <time datetime=\\"2026-06-11\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"132:66\\">Jun 2026</time></p>  <div class=\\"codex-editorial-answer\\" aria-label=\\"Quick answer\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"213:67\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"214:47\\">Quick answer</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-summary\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"215:8\\">Proud Tek supplies RFID tags at wholesale pricing for distributors, resellers, system integrators and large-volume end users. Our wholesale program covers UHF RAIN RFID tags, NFC tags, HF labels, special-purpose industrial tags and wearable tags. With tiered pricing, stock and made-to-order supply modes, dedicated account management and a white-label program that already serves 100+ brands.</p> </div> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-points\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"217:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">For procurement teams, wholesale pricing tiers — aggressive volume discounts at 5K, 10K, 50K, 100K and 1M+ piece levels across all tag categories.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Full RFID tag catalog. UHF inlays, NFC stickers, on-metal tags, laundry tags, asset labels, wristband tags, cable ties, and 50+ other form factors available for wholesale.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Private label and white label. We supply unbranded or with your brand identity on tags, packaging, datasheets and certificates of compliance.</li> </ul>  <div class=\\"codex-hero-cta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"222:37\\"> <a class=\\"codex-hero-cta-btn\\" data-cta-tier=\\"hero\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"223:84\\">Request samples</a>  </div> <div class=\\"codex-hero-trust-bar\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"232:43\\"> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:25\\">Since 2008</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:25\\">ISO 9001</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:25\\">500+</strong> Clients</span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:25\\">50+</strong> Countries</span> </div>  </div> </section>        <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-snapshot\\" id=\\"at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"42:75\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"43:7\\">At a glance</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"44:44\\">Use these short answers to decide whether this page matches the project before moving into the detail.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"45:46\\"> <article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Key takeaway</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">For procurement teams, wholesale pricing tiers — aggressive volume discounts at 5K, 10K, 50K, 100K and 1M+ piece levels across all tag categories.</p>  </article><article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Why wholesalers choose Proud Tek as their RFID tag supplier</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Proud Tek has supplied distributors and resellers since 2008, and wholesale programs now ship to partners in more than 50 countries, with the heaviest concentration in E...</p>  </article><article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Next step</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Ready to move forward? Start your inquiry to get specific answers for this project.</p> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-link\\" href=\\"/contact/rfid-labels-tags/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:74\\">Apply for wholesale pricing</a> </article> </div>  </section>  <nav class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-nav\\" aria-label=\\"On this page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:67\\"><p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:39\\">On this page</p><div class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-links\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:45\\"><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">At a glance</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#why-wholesalers-choose-proud-tek-as-their-rfid-tag-supplier\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Why wholesalers choose Proud Tek as their RFID tag supplier</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#wholesale-rfid-tag-categories\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Wholesale RFID tag categories</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#stock-program-vs-made-to-order-production\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Stock program vs made-to-order production</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#private-label-and-white-label-program\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Private label and white-label program</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#reseller-margin-economics\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Reseller margin economics</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#qualifying-as-a-wholesale-partner\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Qualifying as a wholesale partner</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Useful next pages</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">FAQ</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#next-step\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Next step</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Get a quote</a></div></nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"why-wholesalers-choose-proud-tek-as-their-rfid-tag-supplier\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Why wholesalers choose Proud Tek as their RFID tag supplier</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Proud Tek has supplied distributors and resellers since 2008, and wholesale programs now ship to partners in more than 50 countries, with the heaviest concentration in Europe and the Americas. The economics below are why distributors consolidate on a factory partner instead of juggling trading companies: the middleman margin disappears, the catalog is wide enough to quote whole projects, and the documentation survives customer audits.</p> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar\\" role=\\"list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:52\\"><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">5K+</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">Wholesale min qty</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">50+</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">Tag form factors</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">1-3 days</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">Safety stock dispatch</span></li><li class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:50\\"><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__value\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:55\\">0</span><span class=\\"codex-editorial-stat-bar__label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/StatBar.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:55\\">Private-label surcharge at 10K+</span></li></ul>     <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel\\" role=\\"group\\" aria-label=\\"Before vs after comparison\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:97\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--before\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:94\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:9\\">Buying from a trading company</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">1-2 middlemen adding 15-30% markup</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Limited product range from fragmented suppliers</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">No private-label or white-label support</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:10\\">Inconsistent lead times and quality</li> </ul> </div> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-compare-panel__col codex-editorial-compare-panel__col--after\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:93\\"> <h3 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:9\\">Buying from Proud Tek factory</h3> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:38\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Factory-direct pricing with full wholesale margins</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">100+ tag form factors from one source</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Private-label packaging at no extra charge above 10K</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ComparePanel.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"41:10\\">Dedicated account manager and safety stock program</li> </ul> </div> </div>  <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Factory-direct wholesale eliminates one or two middlemen from the supply chain. Distributors and resellers get manufacturer pricing that leaves healthy margins for their own sales channels.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Broad product catalog means you can source NFC stickers, UHF inlays, industrial hard tags, laundry tags, wristband tags and specialty tags from a single vendor. Simplifying procurement and reducing vendor management overhead.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Dedicated wholesale account managers handle pricing, lead times, quality documentation and logistics coordination so you have a single point of contact for your entire RFID tag supply chain.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Private-label packaging lets you sell under your own brand. We supply tags in your branded boxes, with your datasheets, and your company name on compliance documents and test reports.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Safety stock and consignment programs keep popular SKUs ready for immediate dispatch, reducing your lead times to 1-3 days for fast-moving products.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"wholesale-rfid-tag-categories\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Wholesale RFID tag categories</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">One vendor covering every category is the point of the program: a distributor can quote NFC stickers, UHF inlays and <a href=\\"/solutions/rfid-laundry-tags/\\" title=\\"laundry tags\\">laundry tags</a> on a single purchase order, with one freight booking and one documentation pack. All five categories below ship from the same two Shenzhen factories, so mixed orders consolidate cleanly.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">UHF RAIN RFID: wet inlays, dry inlays, paper labels, on-metal hard tags, hang tags, garment tags, and specialty labels for retail, logistics and industrial applications.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">NFC/HF RFID: NFC stickers (NTAG 213/215/216), NFC wet inlays, anti-metal NFC tags, NFC epoxy tags, NFC tamper-evident tags (NTAG 424 DNA), and ICODE SLIX library tags.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Industrial hard tags: laundry tags (PPS, silicone, textile), cable tie tags, bolt tags, nail tags, ceramic high-temperature tags, and chemical-resistant drum tags.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">LF RFID — 125 kHz animal ear tags, glass capsule tags, and key fob tags for legacy access control and animal identification.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Wearable RFID: silicone wristbands, fabric wristbands, NFC rings, and watch-strap tags for events, healthcare and fitness applications.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"stock-program-vs-made-to-order-production\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Stock program vs made-to-order production</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Wholesale runs on two supply modes. Fast-moving SKUs sit in safety stock, held against your forecast and released on call-off; custom-printed, encoded and specialty items are made to order. Most distributors run both — stock for the running catalog, made-to-order for project business — and the order paperwork tells you which mode each line item is on.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Safety stock and consignment: popular SKUs held for 1-3 day dispatch, with bonded warehouse storage available for distributor safety-stock programs.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Call-off cadence: distributors typically hold a 30-90 day buffer at our warehouse and see call-off shipments within 3-5 business days of release authorization.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Made-to-order: pilot orders of 5,000-50,000 pieces ship in two to three weeks once artwork and encoding files are locked; recurring reorders move on a 3-4 week cycle.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Scheduled releases: place one large order at the best volume tier and receive delivery in multiple batches — weekly, monthly, or on-demand call-off from our warehouse.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Blanket agreements: distributors committing to annual volumes get fixed pricing at the committed tier regardless of individual shipment size.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"private-label-and-white-label-program\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Private label and white-label program</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Most wholesale partners resell under their own brand, so white-label supply is the default rather than an add-on. We currently white-label for more than 100 brands across 50+ countries and maintain strict confidentiality between competing customers — your customers see your brand at every touchpoint, including the compliance paperwork they audit.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Your brand on the product, packaging, datasheets and compliance documentation, with no private-label surcharge on orders above 10,000 pieces.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Packaging formats: bulk poly bag, individual sleeve, retail blister or fully custom branded box, packed for resale distribution.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Confidentiality: NDAs are available on request, and we do not disclose customer programs or cross-sell between competing resellers in the same market.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Branded collateral: we prepare branded product images and specification sheets you can publish on your own website and marketing materials.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Documentation that survives audits: RoHS / REACH declarations, radio-conformity certificates (FCC / CE as applicable) and functional test reports ship with every order, issued under your branding where required while remaining traceable to the production lot.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"reseller-margin-economics\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Reseller margin economics</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">We publish margin benchmarks because distributors who price correctly stay in business and reorder — a partner who marks up 10% and churns helps nobody. The figures below come from our distributor margin guide and reflect 2026 market norms; actual results vary with vertical depth and how much service you attach to the product.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Healthy gross margin runs 25-45% on standard tags and 35-60% on custom OEM programs — the spread reflects whether the reseller adds technical value or just marks up.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Markup norms: 1.4-2.0× factory cost on standard tags and 1.6-2.5× on custom programs; below 1.4× rarely covers sales, support and inventory cost.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Services are the profit engine: encoding, programming and kitting carry 60-80% gross margin, typically charged at $0.05-0.50 per tag on top of the product price.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Local stock premium: inventory that ships to your customers in 2-5 days commands a 15-25% premium over factory lead times for urgent demand.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Recurring structures: distributors moving 50-70% of revenue into annual blanket and managed-inventory structures see 8-15 percentage points of margin lift from amortized acquisition cost.</li></ul>    <aside class=\\"codex-editorial-callout\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:40\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:11\\">Deep dive</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:4\\">Tier-by-tier math — including value-added service pricing, annual contract structures and RFID-as-a-service models — is in our distributor margin guide.</p> <a href=\\"/blog/rfid-reseller-program-distributor-margin-math/\\" class=\\"codex-editorial-callout__link\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:58\\">Learn more <span aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialCallout.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:94\\">→</span></a> </aside> </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"qualifying-as-a-wholesale-partner\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Qualifying as a wholesale partner</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Onboarding is deliberately light: we qualify partners on application fit and reorder potential, not paperwork volume. Expect a quotation within one business day (Monday-Friday, GMT+8), samples in the first week, and a named account manager from the first order onward.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Free samples with RF test data before the first order, so you and your end customer can validate tags against the target reader infrastructure.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Payment terms: pilot orders run 50% deposit, 50% before shipment by T/T; established distributors move to open-account Net 30/60 terms, with LC support at higher volumes.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Dedicated account manager as the single point of contact for pricing, lead times, quality documentation and logistics across all categories.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Logistics options: DHL / FedEx / EMS express, air freight, or sea freight LCL and FCL on standard FOB Shenzhen / Yantian incoterms, with full export documentation handled by our team.</li></ul>     </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Popular wholesale tag products</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">View specifications for our highest-volume wholesale items.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/uhf-rfid-inlay/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">UHF RFID inlays</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-labels/ntag213-nfc-sticker/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">NTAG 213 NFC stickers</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-tags/rfid-anti-metal-tag/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">RFID anti-metal tags</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Related sourcing pages</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Factory pages for the product families most often bundled into wholesale programs.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/lp/rfid-tag-factory/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">RFID tag factory — housed and industrial tags</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/lp/rfid-label-manufacturer/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">RFID label manufacturer — converting and inlays</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/lp/rfid-wristband-manufacturer/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">RFID wristband manufacturer</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/lp/bulk-rfid-cards/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Bulk RFID cards at volume pricing</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-tags/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">RFID tags — full product pillar</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/blog/rfid-tag-wholesale-quote-reading-guide/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">How to read a wholesale RFID quote</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/blog/rfid-tag-moq-negotiation-strategy/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Negotiating below MOQ</strong>  </a> </div> </section> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:7\\">FAQ</h2> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:36\\"> <details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What are the minimum quantities for wholesale RFID tag pricing?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Wholesale pricing begins at 5,000 pieces per SKU. Tier pricing improves at 10K, 50K, 100K and 1M+ levels. For distributors committing to annual volumes, we offer blanket pricing agreements with the best rates regardless of individual shipment size.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Do you offer private-label RFID tags for resellers?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes. We supply RFID tags with your brand name on the product, packaging, datasheets and compliance documentation. We can also host your branded product images and specifications for your website and marketing materials. There is no additional charge for private labeling on orders above 10,000 pieces.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Can wholesale orders be split into multiple shipments?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes. We support scheduled release shipments where you place a single large order for the best volume pricing but receive delivery in multiple batches on your preferred schedule. Weekly, monthly, or on-demand call-off from our warehouse.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What margin should a reseller plan for on RFID tags?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Industry norm is 1.4-2.0× factory cost on standard tags (28-50% gross margin) and 1.6-2.5× on custom programs. The stronger lever is attached services: encoding, programming and kitting carry 60-80% margin at $0.05-0.50 per tag. Our distributor margin guide breaks the math down by vertical and product class.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Should we hold local stock or drop-ship from your factory?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Most distributors do both, by SKU. Drop-ship works for commodity tags where price matters more than speed; local stock earns a 15-25% premium on urgent-need items that ship in 2-5 days. Our safety-stock and scheduled-release programs are designed to feed a local-stock model without tying up your working capital in full production runs.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">What payment terms are available for wholesale partners?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Standard pilot terms are 50% deposit, 50% before shipment, paid by T/T. Established distributors and brand-owner programs move onto open-account terms (Net 30 / Net 60) after the first one or two orders, with LC support for higher volumes. We do not require Western Union or personal-account payment routes.</p> </details> </div> </section>  <section class=\\"codex-trust-signals\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"10:38\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stats\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"11:34\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"12:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"13:15\\">Since 2008</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"14:13\\">RFID Manufacturing</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"16:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"17:15\\">ISO 9001</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"18:13\\">Certified Factory</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:15\\">500+</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:13\\">Enterprise Clients</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:15\\">50+</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:13\\">Countries Served</span> </div> </div> <p class=\\"codex-trust-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:31\\">Proud Tek is a Shenzhen-based RFID &amp; NFC manufacturer supplying hotel chains, transit operators, event venues and retail brands worldwide. Every order includes free samples, RF testing and dedicated project support.</p> </section> <section class=\\"codex-inline-rfq\\" id=\\"quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"70:55\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"71:7\\">Get a Quick Quote</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:6\\">Tell us about your project and we'll respond within one business day. Fields marked <span class=\\"codex-rfq-required\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:142\\">*</span><span class=\\"codex-sr-only\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:178\\">(asterisk)</span> are required.</p> <form action=\\"https://formspree.io/f/xlgorlog\\" method=\\"POST\\" class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-form\\" data-codex-rfq novalidate data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"73:120\\"> <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"_subject\\" value=\\"Inquiry: RFID Tag Wholesale — Distributor Volume Pricing\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"74:6\\"> <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"product\\" value=\\"RFID Tag Wholesale — Distributor Volume Pricing\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:6\\"> <div class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:39\\"> <div class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-field\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"80:47\\"> <label for=\\"codex-rfq-lp-rfid-tag-wholesale-email\\" class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"81:60\\">Your email <span class=\\"codex-rfq-required\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"81:139\\">*</span></label> <span id=\\"codex-rfq-lp-rfid-tag-wholesale-email-hint\\" class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-hint\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"82:67\\">We&#39;ll only use this to reply to your inquiry.</span> <input id=\\"codex-rfq-lp-rfid-tag-wholesale-email\\" name=\\"email\\" type=\\"email\\" required aria-required=\\"true\\" aria-describedby=\\"codex-rfq-lp-rfid-tag-wholesale-email-hint codex-rfq-lp-rfid-tag-wholesale-email-error\\" autocomplete=\\"email\\" inputmode=\\"email\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astr