stro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">Home</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><a href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"102:29\\">RFID Keyfobs</a><span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"104:48\\">/</span><span aria-current=\\"page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Trail.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"100:35\\">RFID Wooden Keyfob</span> </nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-hero\\" data-page-type=\\"product\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"115:106\\"> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-copy\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"116:42\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"117:39\\">Wood RFID keyfob</p> <h1 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"118:9\\">RFID Wooden Keyfob</h1> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-hero-deck\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"119:61\\">FSC Wood, NTAG or MIFARE Chip</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-byline\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"121:41\\">By <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#editorial-board\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"122:63\\">Proud Tek Editorial Board</a> · Reviewed by <a class=\\"codex-byline-name\\" href=\\"/about/review-board/#peter-zhang\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"127:67\\">Peter Zhang</a> · Updated <time datetime=\\"2026-07-02\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"132:66\\">Jul 2026</time></p>  <div class=\\"codex-editorial-answer\\" aria-label=\\"Quick answer\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"213:67\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"214:47\\">Quick answer</p> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-summary\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"215:8\\">The RFID Wooden Keyfob pairs an FSC-certified wood body with a contactless RFID or NFC inlay reading at 1–4 cm typical range. It is designed for membership, access-control, and luxury-branding programs that need a tactile, sustainable alternative to plastic keyfobs without compromising on chip choice or read range. Chip options span NTAG, MIFARE, ICODE, and EM families; MOQ is 100 pieces with a 12–18 working day reorder lead time.</p> </div> <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-points\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"217:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">FSC-certified maple, bamboo, or beech wood body with a stainless-steel split ring.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Compatible with most NTAG, MIFARE, ICODE, and EM chip families.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"218:48\\">Read range 1–4 cm with NTAG 21x; up to 6 cm with MIFARE Plus EV2 on a quality reader.</li> </ul>  <div class=\\"codex-hero-cta\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"222:37\\"> <a class=\\"codex-hero-cta-btn\\" data-cta-tier=\\"hero\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"223:84\\">Request samples</a>  </div> <div class=\\"codex-hero-trust-bar\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"232:43\\"> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"233:25\\">Since 2008</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"234:25\\">ISO 9001</strong></span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"235:25\\">500+</strong> Clients</span> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:18\\"><strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialHero.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"236:25\\">50+</strong> Countries</span> </div>  </div> </section>       <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-related-industries\\" id=\\"used-in-industries\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"18:91\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:7\\">Used in these industries</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:44\\">Deployments where this product is referenced on our industry landing pages.</p> <div class=\\"codex-related-industries-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:46\\"> <a href=\\"/industries/hospitality/\\" class=\\"codex-card codex-card--media codex-related-industry-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:91\\"> <img src=\\"/landing-images/hospitality.jpg\\" alt=\\"Hospitality\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"eager\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:12\\"> <div class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__body\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:56\\"> <span class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__emoji\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:79\\">🏨</span> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:19\\">Hospitality</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:14\\">RFID key cards, guest wristbands and linen tracking tags for hotels, resorts and serviced apartments.</p> </div> </a><a href=\\"/industries/luxury-brands/\\" class=\\"codex-card codex-card--media codex-related-industry-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:91\\"> <img src=\\"/landing-images/ntag424-dna-tamper-evident-tag.jpg\\" alt=\\"Luxury Brands\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"eager\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:12\\"> <div class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__body\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:56\\"> <span class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__emoji\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:79\\">👜</span> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:19\\">Luxury Brands</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:14\\">NFC authentication tags for handbags, sneakers, watches, wines and spirits — tap-to-verify, anti-counterfeit and Digital Product Passport ready.</p> </div> </a><a href=\\"/industries/fitness/\\" class=\\"codex-card codex-card--media codex-related-industry-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"23:91\\"> <img src=\\"/landing-images/pvc-rfid-wristband.png\\" alt=\\"Fitness\\" width=\\"1200\\" height=\\"675\\" loading=\\"eager\\" decoding=\\"async\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:12\\"> <div class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__body\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:56\\"> <span class=\\"codex-related-industry-card__emoji\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:79\\">💪</span> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:19\\">Fitness</strong> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/RelatedIndustriesGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:14\\">Member access cards, NFC fitness wristbands and key fobs for gyms, health clubs and 24/7 unstaffed facilities.</p> </div> </a> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-snapshot\\" id=\\"at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"42:75\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"43:7\\">At a glance</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"44:44\\">Use these short answers to decide whether this page matches the project before moving into the detail.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"45:46\\"> <article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Specification</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Material: FSC-certified maple, bamboo, or beech (custom species available). Dimensions: 35 × 30 × 4 mm typical; 28 × 28 × 5 mm on request.</p>  </article><article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Marking</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Laser engraving (recommended): logo, member name, sequential number, QR. Two-sided engraving available on request.</p>  </article><article class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-snapshot-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:65\\"> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:49\\">Next step</p> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:12\\">Ready to move forward? Start your inquiry to get specific answers for this project.</p> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-link\\" href=\\"/contact/access-control-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:74\\">Start a wood keyfob inquiry</a> </article> </div> <dl class=\\"codex-editorial-brief-grid codex-editorial-brief-grid--extra\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/DecisionSnapshot.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"57:78\\"> <div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:52\\"> <dt data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:7\\">Sourcing</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:7\\">  <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">MOQ: 100 pieces per chip family and engraving combination.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Sample turnaround: 7–10 working days.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Reorder lead time: 12–18 working days.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Encoding included: UID lock, NDEF, custom block writes.</li> </ul>  </dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:52\\"> <dt data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:7\\">Best-fit applications</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"35:7\\">  <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:40\\"> <li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Hotel and resort member keyfobs (premium and eco-positioning programs).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Gym, fitness, and country-club membership credentials.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Office and residential access control with sustainability story.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Luxury automotive and sailing club access.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/BriefField.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"39:40\\">Brand giveaway and gift programs.</li> </ul>  </dd> </div> </dl> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-commercial-terms\\" id=\\"commercial-terms\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"47:87\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"48:7\\">Commercial terms</h2> <dl class=\\"codex-editorial-brief-grid codex-commercial-terms__grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"49:71\\"> <div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">MOQ</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Varies by SKU — stock items from 100 pcs; custom production typically 500-1,000 pcs</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Lead time</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Production 2-3 weeks after artwork and encoding sign-off; reorders on a 3-4 week cycle</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Samples</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Free samples and RF test report with every order; courier at customer cost</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Payment</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">50% T/T deposit, 50% before shipment; Net 30/60 for established accounts; LC for large orders</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Shipping</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">FOB Shenzhen / Yantian; DHL, FedEx or EMS air freight; sea LCL / FCL for volume</dd> </div><div class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-brief-card codex-commercial-terms__item\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"51:87\\"> <dt class=\\"codex-editorial-answer-label\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"52:50\\">Response</dt> <dd data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"53:13\\">Itemized quote within one business day, Mon-Fri (UTC+8)</dd> </div> </dl> <p class=\\"codex-commercial-terms__note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"57:43\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-snapshot-link\\" href=\\"/rfq/?product=rfid-keyfobs\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/CommercialTerms.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"58:61\\">Full terms in your quote →</a> </p> </section> <nav class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-nav\\" aria-label=\\"On this page\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:67\\"><p class=\\"codex-editorial-kicker\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:39\\">On this page</p><div class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-links\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:45\\"><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#at-a-glance\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">At a glance</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#why-a-wood-keyfob-instead-of-plastic-or-metal\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Why a wood keyfob instead of plastic or metal</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#where-wood-keyfobs-underperform\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Where wood keyfobs underperform</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#how-we-test-before-shipping\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">How we test before shipping</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Useful next pages</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">FAQ</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#next-step\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Next step</a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-jump-link\\" href=\\"#quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/JumpNav.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:67\\">Get a quote</a></div></nav> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"why-a-wood-keyfob-instead-of-plastic-or-metal\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Why a wood keyfob instead of plastic or metal</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">ABS plastic and zinc-alloy keyfobs dominate the access-control market because they are cheap, durable, and easy to engrave. Wood keyfobs cost more, dent more easily, and need a sealed finish for outdoor use. They earn their place when the program needs a sustainability narrative or a premium tactile feel that plastic and metal cannot deliver.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Biodegradable wood body; recyclable stainless-steel hardware (24 mm or 30 mm split ring).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">FSC chain of custody documented for sustainability audits.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Distinct hand feel: the 35 × 30 × 4 mm body is warmer and quieter than ABS or zinc alloy.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Laser-friendly: engraves crisply without ink lamination.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Brand-positioning value: luxury, hospitality, eco-conscious memberships.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"where-wood-keyfobs-underperform\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">Where wood keyfobs underperform</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Honest about limits: a wood keyfob is not the right choice for every program.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Outdoor or wet environments: humidity warps unsealed wood. Use lacquer or skip wood.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Heavy-use industrial: ABS or zinc lasts longer in trades and industrial keyrings (24–36 months versus 12–18 for wood).</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Cost-sensitive bulk: PVC or ABS at high volume undercuts wood by 30–50%.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Aggressive print artwork: wood grain shows through full-color UV print.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Long-distance UHF: wood adds dielectric mass that detunes UHF antennas.</li></ul>     </section><section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"how-we-test-before-shipping\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:2\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/EditorialSection.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"76:7\\">How we test before shipping</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionIntro.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"19:2\\">Every encoded keyfob passes the same QC pipeline as our plastic keyfobs, with a wood-specific finish check.</p>        <ul class=\\"codex-editorial-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"38:38\\"><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">100% functional read test on every encoded keyfob.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Hardware torque test on the split ring attachment.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Lamination and lacquer cure: 48 hours before engraving or shipping.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Engraving QC: visual check on depth, contrast, registration.</li><li data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/SectionList.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"40:10\\">Pack-out: bulk poly bag, individual sleeve, or branded box on request.</li></ul>     </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section codex-editorial-resource-shell\\" id=\\"useful-next-pages\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:81\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Useful next pages</h2> <p class=\\"codex-editorial-section-intro\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:44\\">Use these linked product, guide and comparison pages to keep the next click specific and practical.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-resource-grid\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceGrid.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:46\\"> <section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Related keyfob SKUs</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Other keyfobs in the catalog with overlapping chip options or alternative materials.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/em4305-keyfob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">EM4305 keyfob (LF, ABS body)</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/mifare-desfire-keyfob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">MIFARE DESFire keyfob</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/dual-frequency-key-fob/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Dual-frequency keyfob</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">All RFID keyfobs</strong>  </a> </div> </section><section class=\\"codex-card codex-editorial-card\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"31:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"32:7\\">Compare and decide</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"33:6\\">Pages that help with the keyfob-versus-card-versus-wristband decision and material choice.</p> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-link-list\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"34:42\\"> <a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/compare/keyfob-vs-card-vs-wristband-access-control/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Keyfob vs card vs wristband</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/contact/access-control-keyfobs/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Start an access-control keyfob inquiry</strong>  </a><a class=\\"codex-editorial-link-card\\" href=\\"/products/rfid-cards/standard-rfid-wood-card/\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"36:61\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/ResourceCard.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"37:17\\">Wood RFID card (matching material)</strong>  </a> </div> </section> </div> </section> <section class=\\"codex-editorial-section\\" id=\\"faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:50\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:7\\">FAQ</h2> <div class=\\"codex-editorial-faq\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:36\\"> <details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Can the wood keyfob open hotel-lock readers?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes, with the right chip. MIFARE Plus EV2 and MIFARE DESFire EV3 wood keyfobs work with Saflok, VingCard, Onity, Salto, and Häfele Dialock systems. Read range is shorter than a flat card because of the keyfob form factor; 2–4 cm is realistic on standard hotel readers.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">How long does the wood keyfob last on a daily-use keyring?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Expect 12–18 months before noticeable wear from pocket use, friction against keys, and humidity. ABS or zinc-alloy keyfobs last 24–36 months in the same conditions. Wood is a deliberate trade-off: shorter life for tactile and sustainability value.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Is dual-frequency available?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Yes, on request. We can pair an HF chip (NTAG, MIFARE, ICODE) with a 125 kHz LF chip (EM4100 or EM4305) in the same wood body. Dimensions and lead time both increase. Confirm reader requirements before ordering.</p> </details><details data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"28:16\\"> <summary data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:18\\">Will the engraving fade?</summary> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/Faq.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"30:12\\">Laser engraving carbonizes the wood and does not fade in normal use. UV print and color-fill engraving wear over time depending on handling. Sealed lacquer slows wear on all marking methods.</p> </details> </div> </section>  <section class=\\"codex-trust-signals\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"10:38\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stats\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"11:34\\"> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"12:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"13:15\\">Since 2008</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"14:13\\">RFID Manufacturing</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"16:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"17:15\\">ISO 9001</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"18:13\\">Certified Factory</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"20:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"21:15\\">500+</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"22:13\\">Enterprise Clients</span> </div> <div class=\\"codex-trust-stat\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"24:35\\"> <strong data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"25:15\\">50+</strong> <span data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"26:13\\">Countries Served</span> </div> </div> <p class=\\"codex-trust-note\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/TrustSignals.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"29:31\\">Proud Tek is a Shenzhen-based RFID &amp; NFC manufacturer supplying hotel chains, transit operators, event venues and retail brands worldwide. Every order includes free samples, RF testing and dedicated project support.</p> </section> <section class=\\"codex-inline-rfq\\" id=\\"quick-quote\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"70:55\\"> <h2 data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"71:7\\">Get a Quick Quote</h2> <p data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:6\\">Tell us about your project and we'll respond within one business day. Fields marked <span class=\\"codex-rfq-required\\" aria-hidden=\\"true\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:142\\">*</span><span class=\\"codex-sr-only\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"72:178\\">(asterisk)</span> are required.</p> <form action=\\"https://formspree.io/f/xlgorlog\\" method=\\"POST\\" class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-form\\" data-codex-rfq novalidate data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"73:120\\"> <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"_subject\\" value=\\"Inquiry: RFID Wooden Keyfob — FSC Wood, NTAG or MIFARE Chip\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"74:6\\"> <input type=\\"hidden\\" name=\\"product\\" value=\\"RFID Wooden Keyfob — FSC Wood, NTAG or MIFARE Chip\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/components/editorial/InlineRfqForm.astro\\" data-astro-source-loc=\\"75:6\\"> <div class=\\"codex-inline-rfq-row\\" data-astro-source-file=\\"<project-root>/src/co